<view class="page"><view class="profile-card"><view class="profile-mark">薪</view><view class="profile-name">薪算</view><view class="profile-desc">让每一份收入都清清楚楚</view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">本地记录</view><view class="link" bindtap="clearHistory">清空</view></view><view wx:if="{{history.length}}" class="history-list"><view class="history-item" wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="index"><view><view class="history-title">{{item.city}} · 税前 ¥{{item.gross}}</view><view class="history-date">{{item.date}}</view></view><view class="history-right"><view class="history-net">¥{{item.net}}</view><view class="history-caption">每月到手</view></view></view></view><view wx:else class="empty-card"><view class="empty-icon">↗</view><view class="empty-title">还没有计算记录</view><view class="empty-desc">完成一次工资计算后，可在这里保存结果</view><button class="secondary-btn empty-btn" bindtap="goSalary">去计算工资</button></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-title">关于与设置</view><view class="settings-card"><view class="setting-row" bindtap="privacy"><text>隐私说明</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="disclaimer"><text>计算口径与免责声明</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="about"><text>关于薪算</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></view></view></view>